            "review_title": "Review at Happy Papa’s",
            "review_text": "John S\n1 contribution\n0\nI found an amazing place to eat in nhu Trang\nMar 2023 • Couples\nI added Happy Papa,s to trip advisor because it has been some of the best food I have tasted out dinning in nhu Trang. The beef with the sauce and potato is amazing. The presentation of the food is outstanding. Don’t take my word try it out. \nI shouldn’t tell everyone or I might not get a table lol, Neely opened and I think it will be popular once word gets out. Food, you will love it\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 21, 2023",
